{"n":8,"title":"My place (no filter)","blurb":"Говорить, где вы живёте и что где находится","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"My place (no filter)","sub":"","html":"<p>Где ты живёшь, честная экскурсия по дому — и как в нём сориентироваться.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Говорить, где вы живёте</li><li>Говорить, что есть в вашем доме</li><li>Спрашивать, где что находится</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Выберите комнаты в вашем доме.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"kitchen"},{"label":"bedroom"},{"label":"bathroom"},{"label":"living room"},{"label":"garden"},{"label":"balcony"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"live","pos":"","ru":"жить","kk":"тұру","def":"I live in Almaty.","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-live.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/98aadb37083e.mp3"},{"en":"flat","pos":"","ru":"квартира","kk":"пәтер","def":"I live in a small flat.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/b9c7b42de27f.mp3"},{"en":"house","pos":"","ru":"дом","kk":"үй","def":"Their house is near the school.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/5be93480bd8b.mp3"},{"en":"home","pos":"","ru":"дом (родной)","kk":"үй (өз үйі)","def":"I'm at home today.","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"kitchen","pos":"","ru":"кухня","kk":"ас үй","def":"The fridge is in the kitchen.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/0eaab68b830c.mp3"},{"en":"bedroom","pos":"","ru":"спальня","kk":"жатын бөлме","def":"The bed is in the bedroom.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/cb5615c6dfde.mp3"},{"en":"bathroom","pos":"","ru":"ванная","kk":"жуынатын бөлме","def":"The shower is in the bathroom.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/72bfb05496f9.mp3"},{"en":"living room","pos":"","ru":"гостиная","kk":"қонақ бөлме","def":"The sofa is in the living room.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/cfd58e2d7aa6.mp3"},{"en":"room","pos":"","ru":"комната","kk":"бөлме","def":"There are three rooms.","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/cb5615c6dfde.mp3","prompt":"Где кровать?","options":["in the kitchen","in the bedroom","in the bathroom"],"answer":"in the bedroom","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/0eaab68b830c.mp3","before":"The fridge is in the","after":".","answers":["kitchen"],"bank":["kitchen","bedroom","garden"]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/cfd58e2d7aa6.mp3","prompt":"Где диван?","options":["in the living room","in the bedroom","on the balcony"],"answer":"in the living room","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"city","pos":"","ru":"город (большой)","kk":"қала","def":"Almaty is a big city.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/2c54892c40a1.mp3"},{"en":"town","pos":"","ru":"город (небольшой)","kk":"шағын қала","def":"It's a small town.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"village","pos":"","ru":"деревня","kk":"ауыл","def":"My parents live in a village.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"street","pos":"","ru":"улица","kk":"көше","def":"Our house is at number 36 Judson Street.","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-street.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/d3a9fb075d49.mp3"},{"en":"garden","pos":"","ru":"сад","kk":"бақ","def":"There isn't a garden.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/b1ade531057f.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Almaty is a big","after":".","answers":["city"],"bank":["town","city","village"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I","after":"in a small flat.","answers":["live"],"bank":["study","work","live"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"My parents live in a","after":".","answers":["village"],"bank":["city","village","street"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Один предмет или больше?","items":[{"text":"There's a great bakery.","src":null},{"text":"There are 4,000 people.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"there is / there are","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Один предмет</th><th>Два и больше</th></tr><tr><td>+</td><td>There's a theatre.</td><td>There are supermarkets.</td></tr><tr><td>–</td><td>There isn't a theatre.</td><td>There aren't any hotels.</td></tr><tr><td>?</td><td>Is there a car park?</td><td>Are there any towels?</td></tr></table><p><b>There's</b> — один предмет, <b>there are</b> — два и больше.</p><p>В вопросах и отрицаниях с множественным — <b>any</b>: aren't <b>any</b> hotels.</p><p>Короткие ответы: <b>Yes, there is.</b> / <b>No, there isn't.</b></p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Где это?","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Слова</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>in</td><td>The bed is in the bedroom.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>on</td><td>The table is on the balcony.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>next to</td><td>The toilets are next to the gym.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>near</td><td>Our house is near the school.</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>on the left / right</td><td>The lift is on the left.</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>upstairs / over there</td><td>The bathroom is upstairs.</td></tr></table><p><b>in</b> — внутри комнаты или города. <b>on</b> — на поверхности.</p><p><b>next to</b> — прямо рядом. <b>near</b> — недалеко.</p><p>Чтобы спросить: <b>Where's the…?</b> или <b>Where are the…?</b></p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">at + время будет в уроке 11.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["Where do you live?","I live in a flat in Almaty.","There's one bedroom.","There aren't any hotels.","The toilets are next to the lift.","The bathroom is upstairs."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ a great bakery.","options":["There are","There's","There aren't"],"keep":false,"answer":"There's","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ 4,000 people.","options":["There are","There's","There isn't"],"keep":false,"answer":"There are","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ any hotels.","options":["There isn't","There's","There aren't"],"keep":false,"answer":"There aren't","why":"Множественное + отрицание → there aren't any.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The bed is","after":"the bedroom.","answers":["in"],"bank":["in","next to","on"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The table is","after":"the balcony.","answers":["on"],"bank":["in","near","on"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The toilets are","after":"the gym.","answers":["next to"],"bank":["next to","in","upstairs"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"is или are?","sub":"","columns":["There is","There are"],"items":[{"text":"a garden","col":0},{"text":"a kitchen","col":0},{"text":"four rooms","col":1},{"text":"supermarkets","col":1},{"text":"a lift","col":0},{"text":"two bedrooms","col":1}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["big","is","kitchen.","There","a"],"answer":"There is a big kitchen.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["are","Where","toilets?","the"],"answer":"Where are the toilets?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["is","left.","on","lift","the","The"],"answer":"The lift is on the left.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["There","is","two","bedrooms."],"bad":1,"answer":"There are two bedrooms.","why":"Два и больше → there are."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["There","aren't","some","hotels."],"bad":2,"answer":"There aren't any hotels.","why":"В отрицании — any."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","live","on","a","small","flat."],"bad":2,"answer":"I live in a small flat.","why":"Внутри жилья → in."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/77deb3fd6752.mp3","prompt":"Что вы слышите?","options":["There are 4,000 people.","There's a great bakery.","There's a theatre."],"answer":"There's a great bakery.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/b71aa7f2f56f.mp3","prompt":"Утверждение или отрицание?","options":["Positive — there are hotels.","Negative — there aren't any hotels."],"answer":"Negative — there aren't any hotels.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/5146e33fedf9.mp3","before":"There","after":"a theatre.","answers":["isn't"],"bank":["isn't","aren't","is"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/884bd68eaaed.mp3","prompt":"— Is there a hotel car park?","options":["Yes, there is.","No, there isn't.","Yes, there are."],"answer":"Yes, there is.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/136171b9da14.mp3","prompt":"— Where are the toilets?","options":["Upstairs.","Next to the gym.","On the left."],"answer":"Next to the gym.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/fa8c6a737b10.mp3","prompt":"Есть ли ванна?","options":["Yes, there is.","No, but there's a shower.","No, and there isn't a shower."],"answer":"No, but there's a shower.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Сэма.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Sam lives in a flat.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"There is a garden.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The lift is","after":"to the exit.","answers":["next"],"bank":["in","on","next"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Сколько там спален?","options":["Two","One","Three"],"keep":false,"answer":"One","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о своём доме.","sub":"Что есть и чего нет.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I live in ___ .</li><li>There's ___ .</li><li>There isn't ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I live in</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a flat</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a house</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">There's</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">There are</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">There isn't</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a garden</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">two bedrooms</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a big kitchen</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>После <b>live</b> я поставил(а) <b>in</b>.</li><li>Один предмет → <b>there's</b>; два и больше → <b>there are</b>.</li><li>В отрицании есть <b>isn't</b> или <b>aren't</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["Where do you live?","I live in a flat in Almaty.","There's a big kitchen.","Where are the toilets?"]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 8 пройден","sub":"Урок 8 из 24 · Юнит 3","items":["Я могу сказать, где живу.","Я могу использовать there is и there are.","Я могу спросить, где что находится."]}]}
